<h2>🛡️ 9. WATCHDOG Y SUPERVISION</h2>

<h3>9.1 OpenClaw Watchdog (cada 2 min)</h3>
<code># /usr/local/bin/openclaw-watchdog.sh
# - curl health 18789
# - pkill stale node 18789
# - PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE) en SQLite
# - relanza gateway
# - relanza tunnel
# - extrae nueva URL y actualiza tracking</code>

<h3>9.2 MCP bridge watchdog (manual, en watchdog principal)</h3>
<code>curl health 18791 → si DOWN, pkill + relanza python3 mcp_bridge.py</code>

<h3>9.3 Extras panel watchdog (manual, en watchdog principal)</h3>
<code>curl health 18790 → si DOWN, pkill + relanza python3 extras_gateway.py</code>

